      ],
      "content": "Validate shape and dtype assumptions at tool boundaries before vectorized processing. Do not infer telemetry layout from a sample file or rely on implicit dtype conversion when units/ranges matter.",
      "source_ref": "https://numpy.org/doc/stable/user/basics.html",
